  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Field Epidemiology (Asia-Pacific)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will fund 3 field epidemiology training programs in the Pacific and Southeast Asia. The programs will deliver workshops and courses in: field epidemiology, veterinary field epidemiology, rapid response team, One Health frontline epidemiology and leadership.  Programs will also provide continual support and guidance to graduates of field epidemiology training programs through mentoring, train the trainers sessions, leadership training and regional networks.</narrative>
  </description>
